FIX AT THE BIRTH SITE (src/os/suite_matrix_reconcile.py):
  LEG_NAME_PREFIX / LEG_NAME_SUFFIX declare the runner name family once.
  newest_pass_leg_scanned gains an optional `names` restriction; the walk
  block keeps its published shape exactly ({"considered","decoded"}, plus
  "ceiling"/"bounded" only when the bound engages).
  resolve_walk_leg asks the family FIRST and the whole pile SECOND; a family
  miss falls through to the unchanged pile walk, so a foreign-named leg is
  still reachable and no leg can be hidden by the predicate.

